Z||000005||My7Fieros||11-23-2000||06:22 PM||||HERES AN IDEA FOR REAL TIME CHAT...Im on it alot..even though no one else is..heres what I do...since its a SEPERATE page, I log onto it after I log onto the forum...then, I "push" the chat page over to the left (just enought so that I can see my name)and put the forum page over it (with the name section of the chat page on the left so I can see the names)..that way while Im on the forum, if anyone else logs onto the chat room, I'll see it..everyone should do it.||||reg||1
